            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A GridView composed over ItemsView. Ctrl/Shift-click to multi-select, then double-click any selected tile: the selection is kept and itemDoubleTapped reports the whole set. Enable check box selection to toggle items with hover check boxes like File Explorer." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A GridView composed over ItemsView. Ctrl/Shift-click to multi-select, then double-click any selected tile: the selection is kept and itemDoubleTapped reports the whole set. Enable check box selection to toggle items with hover check boxes like File Explorer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "基于 ItemsView 组合的网格视图。用 Ctrl/Shift 点击进行多选后，双击其中任意一项：选择保持不变，并通过 itemDoubleTapped 事件携带完整的选择集合。开启复选框选择后，可用资源管理器式的悬停复选框逐项勾选。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
